00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:07.980
of this products.

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:12.600
What Google want to do
with Google Cloud platform

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:17.910
is to let their
enterprise customers use

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:20.700
the same platform,
the same technology

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:27.750
services, the same hardware,
network, software stack

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:33.720
that you heard about this
morning that Google itself use

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.790
to run its products.

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.720
Google wants to let
this platform be

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:41.160
a label to their
enterprise customers

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:50.010
so they can run their
products on this platform.

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:53.860
During the years, Google
developed a series

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:57.300
