00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:16.080
project and Dremel and board,
for example, that became

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:19.260
Kubernetes or TensorFlow.

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:21.270
And in Google
Cloud Platform, you

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:24.320
find the same
technologies productizes

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:28.090
as a service for customer
that you see here

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:32.550
